  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="f60f-9102-a048-c8a8" name="Eastern Steppe Nomads: Wusun (Art of War) - List Notes" publicationId="b792-78e1-7b03-d4d6" hidden="false">
      <description>WUSUN (The Art of War, p.69): Ili basin nomads allied to the Han from 110 BCE. Allies (up to 25% instead of selected options): Eastern Han from the Han Chinese list (documented only). Caravans and Yurts (common Special Units section at the end of the Eastern Steppe Nomads chapter) are covered in the Xiongnu catalogue notes. Percentage limits are by points. "May only have one selected option per 1,000 points" for Special Units is documented only.

ARMY COMPOSITION:
[Wusun]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Cavalry: at least 50%
  Infantry: up to 25%
  Special Units: up to 25%
  WUSUN. Characters up to 25%. Cavalry at least 50%. Infantry up to 25%. Special Units up to 25% (one selected option per 1,000 points). May have up to 25% Allies (Eastern Han from the Han Chinese list) instead of selected options (documented only). Horse Archers may have the Fast Pass ability.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
